{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54000","headline":"十二时歌 五 · 从谂","name":"十二时歌 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禺中巳，削发谁知到如此。\n无端被请作村僧，屈辱饥凄受欲死。\n胡张三，黑李四，恭敬不曾生些子。\n适来忽尔到门头，唯道借茶兼借纸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"从谂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}